","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (New), Breakfast & Brunch, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Coffee & Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"hfbZ97Te3T4jeWN6GgsGrQ","review_id":"Ento_9X8X-Pt-k-fKmfeBw","date":"2019-01-28T17:01:29","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9481754899024963,"text_excerpt":"Came here for Saturday brunch. Unlike everything else in NOLA this was quite wait, we waited for almost an hour and a half but thank goodness for the coffee bar. I also very much appreciate that they had an oat milk option. Once we were seated we pretty much knew what we wanted to order but then there were some specials and ended up needing a few more minutes. For cocktails I ordered the boozy coffee and my friend ordered the jean and jam. YUM YUM YUM! I didn't love my boozy coffee but the Jean and jam was just amazing! For food we ended up getting the shrimp and grits, steak and eggs and biscuit with butter and jam. Everything was so tasty. I loved my choice of steak and eggs. The steak ..."},{"business_id":"hfbZ97Te3T4jeWN6GgsGrQ","review_id":"O3EppI8S_jusQ_7GkFcSXw","date":"2019-02-19T01:38:46","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9434477090835571,"text_excerpt":"Came here for a \"Siblings Weekend\" with my twin and two younger sisters. Great time catching up. Someone recommended this place and - being a fan of Besh restaurants - jumped on the chance. Love the atmosphere - clean, simple, chic. Ordered an \"Afternoon Delight\" cocktail - delicious. We also had the creole tomato with truffle soup - AMAZING. The pimento cheese appetizer was also terrific. The crackers that came with it could have been swapped out for something less \"commercial\" - but it was still delicious, including the pickled vegetables. The Artichoke plus \"cheese business\" - which is something probably from another planet - but it was delicious, light - which seems crazy almost - but..."},{"business_id":"hfbZ97Te3T4jeWN6GgsGrQ","review_id":"3awIHM--G_-_RX1tLCuLQw","date":"2019-01-18T14:12:32","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9414424896240234,"text_excerpt":"I love this place! I had the avocado toast with a poached egg (my favorite) and it was one of the best I've ever eaten. I was in love with it. I wish I could pack this place up and bring it home with me. It's the perfect brunch spot. They have so many intriguing items to choose from. My friend got the honey chicken and I even liked that. They have a mimosa bar where you pick different juices and they bring them out all together with a bottle of champagne. They have a lot of specialty teas and hot drinks on the menu as well. The waitress was good, she was nice and fast. She gave us several really good suggestions and seemed to know the menu very well. I would 100% recommend this place. It ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"hfbZ9